    <item>
      <title>How the Vue Blocks theme is layered</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8080/?p=2</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 06 Oct 2026 12:05:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost:8080/?p=2</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Vue.js 3 sits on top of PHP-rendered HTML; the Vue app mounts onto DOM the server already produced. The page works without JavaScript; Vue only enhances.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A look at the server-first / progressive-enhancement approach.]]></excerpt:encoded>
      <wp:post_id>2</wp:post_id>
